{"t":"Energy Wave","s":"energy-wave-1e752","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Energy_Wave_e8e371.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Energy Wave</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Energy Wave\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Wave_e8e371.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exevo vis hur</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Energy Damage</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">170</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Attack Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Attack_Cooldown_61cf3f.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Attack (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">38</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"basepower\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base Power</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">150</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Electrified Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span> Shoots a powerful area attack directly in front of the caster, dealing strong energy damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>A variation of the popular Energy Beam , casting this spell causes a cone of energy to unfold in front of the caster that inflicts considerable damage to all unfortunate creatures that are hit. Due to its peculiar form it is especially useful when used in closed spaces or against fleeing enemies. Like its relative, the Energy Wave spell is not bound to a rune, requiring the sorcerer to invest mana at the point of time when it is cast. Although the cost is substantial the comparatively large area of effect and the amount of damage that is caused usually justify using the spell.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>With the Wheel of Destiny/Conviction Perks, it's possible to increase its damage and area.\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Wave animation\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Wave_animation_117395.gif\" width=\"160\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-spell-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Before the Winter Update 2007, the incantation was <i>exevo mort hur</i>. The update changed the spell's animation as well.</li></ul>\n<center>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Before\n</th>\n<th>After\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy wave1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_wave1_06eab9.gif\" width=\"160\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy wave1(after winter update 2007)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_wave1_after_winter_update_2007_f7e460.gif\" width=\"160\"/></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</center>\n<ul><li>It used to deal more damage than <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Energy%20Beam\">Great Energy Beam</a>, but that changed when the Wheel of Destiny was implemented in an effort to make Beam Mastery more appealing.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Attack_Spells\">Attack Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Annihilation</li><li>Apprentice's Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a></li><li>Brutal Strike</li><li>Buzz</li><li>Chained Penance</li><li>Chill Out</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Curse\">Curse</a></li><li>Death Echo</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Strike\">Death Strike</a></li><li>Devastating Knockout</li><li>Divine Barrage</li><li>