>Terra Burst</li><li>Terra Strike</li><li>Terra Wave</li><li>Thousand Fist Blows</li><li>Tiger Clash</li><li>Ultimate Energy Strike</li><li>Ultimate Flame Strike</li><li>Ultimate Ice Strike</li><li>Ultimate Terra Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Whirlwind%20Throw\">Whirlwind Throw</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wrath%20of%20Nature\">Wrath of Nature</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["elemental-spheres-quest","elvenbane-quest"]}